# main = production-ready code only (wp-content/themes/easy-quran-classes-child/
# and, if ever added, wp-content/plugins/easy-quran-classes-core/), plus
# .github/workflows/ (the auto-deploy pipeline itself, which must live on
# main for GitHub Actions to trigger on push to main). Local tooling,
# Claude/AI configuration, project docs and reference assets live
# on the development branch, never here.
.claude/
local/
tools/
tests/
Assests/
ref_website/
.mcp.json
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CPANEL-WORKFLOW.md
DESIGN.md
README-SETUP.md
TASK.md
TASK-*.md
TOOL-INVENTORY.md

